      <a href="/tools/uk-btl-stress-test-calculator" class="card">
        <div class="card-icon">📉</div>
        <h2>UK BTL Stress Test</h2>
        <p>Test your rental property against interest rate hikes and tenant defaults.</p>
        <span class="cta">Calculate &rarr;</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/tools/uk-sell-vs-rent-out-calculator" class="card">
